{
  "id": "769",
  "title": "What Should We Buy?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-09-26",
  "synopsis": "Little Le and Paul are talking about what they need to get from the store.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1159/0e93611f84c8931a65c74b8990164d81fa68ca33.mp3?1569233944",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我们要买什么？\n\n小乐：保罗，今天我们得去买吃的了。\n保罗：好的。我们要买什么？\n小乐：我们要买水果、肉、米、茶……\n保罗：好的。对了，我们再买些啤酒吧！\n小乐：想得美！",
    "traditional": "我們要買什麼？\n\n小樂：保羅，今天我們得去買吃的了。\n保羅：好的。我們要買什麼？\n小樂：我們要買水果、肉、米、茶……\n保羅：好的。對了，我們再買些啤酒吧！\n小樂：想得美！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Should We Buy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：保罗，今天我们得去买吃的了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：保羅，今天我們得去買吃的了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bǎo luó jīn tiān wǒ men děi qù mǎi chī de le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Paul, we have to go buy stuff to eat today."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的。我们要买什么？",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的。我們要買什麼？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de wǒ men yào mǎi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok. What should we buy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：我们要买水果、肉、米、茶……",
      "traditional": "小樂：我們要買水果、肉、米、茶……",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ men yào mǎi shuǐ guǒ ròu mǐ chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: We should buy fruit, meat, rice, tea…"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：好的。对了，我们再买些啤酒吧！",
      "traditional": "保羅：好的。對了，我們再買些啤酒吧！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo de duì le wǒ men zài mǎi xiē pí jiǔ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok. Oh, that’s right, let’s also buy some beer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：想得美！",
      "traditional": "小樂：想得美！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè xiǎng de měi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You wish!"
    }
  ],
